      "message": "@thestig, can you PTAL?\n\nMy original plan here was to refactor the new `GetScanlineSize` method further - replacing `src_components_count_` and `src_bits_per_component_` with `dst_format_`.  It turned out that this would be incorrect - BMP may first decode with 1 byte per pixel into temporary `dest_buf_` (described by `src_components_count_` and `src_bits_per_component_`) and then resample into `device_buffer_` - we can\u0027t describe both of those with a single `dst_format_`.\n\nBut, I think this refactoring may still be nice/desirable on its own, even if it doesn\u0027t unblock anything else.\n\nWDYT?",
